edgeR 4.0.16  limma 3.58.1 
P(p<.05)/P(p<.01): fraction of genes with raw p below the level (on null data: type I error rate);
 BH<.05: mean number of genes with BH-adjusted p < 0.05; FDR: mean fraction of those that are not DE; power: fraction of DE genes found

